; A control operator on `any` (`any .size 4`; equally ranges / `.lt` / `.cbor`) is a GRACEFUL
; rejection at the top-level-rule position: `any` already accepts every CBOR item, so the constraint
; is semantically empty, and `any` is not a primitive the size/range machinery can bound (it would
; otherwise panic unwrapping `ident_to_primitive`) — allow on demand once
; a fixture proves a meaningful semantics.
x = any .size 4
